                 │               │
                 ▼               ▼
              MERGE        EXPLAIN + FIX
```

MergeMind's ultimate goal is to transform merge validation from:

```text
"Do these files conflict?"
```

into:

```text
"Do these software changes conflict?"
```

and eventually:

```text
"Will the resulting system still behave correctly?"
```

